1
00:00:00,972 --> 00:00:03,042
(Howard:)Threw my arm out.

2
00:00:05,344 --> 00:00:07,174
(Bernadette:)All right, the pitcher's mound
in Major League Baseball

3
00:00:07,179 --> 00:00:09,609
is 60 feet, six inches
away from home plate.

4
00:00:09,614 --> 00:00:11,814
(Howard:)Great. You take this

5
00:00:11,817 --> 00:00:13,887
(Howard:)and say when to stop.

6
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:21,061
(Howard:)How much further?

7
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:22,889
(Bernadette:)Keep going.

8
00:00:24,896 --> 00:00:25,996
(Howard:)How about now?

9
00:00:25,997 --> 00:00:28,767
(Bernadette:)I'll let you know.

10
00:00:31,002 --> 00:00:34,142
Are you saying "stop" and we're
just too far away to hear you?

11
00:00:34,139 --> 00:00:36,039
(Bernadette:)Okay, stop.

12
00:00:40,011 --> 00:00:42,411
(Howard:)Are you kidding me?!

13
00:00:42,414 --> 00:00:43,984
That's 60 feet.

14
00:00:43,982 --> 00:00:46,512
(Howard:)There's no way
this is 60 feet.

15
00:00:46,518 --> 00:00:48,888
(Bernadette:)I'm looking at it.

16
00:00:50,055 --> 00:00:51,685
(Howard:)You realize this isn't
one of those times

17
00:00:51,690 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)I want you to exaggerate
how long something is.

